    "tpl-center-focus-09 Card label: \"KEYWORDS\" -> \"IN YOUR CHART\" (there is no per-Center keyword content for both states).",
    "tpl-center-focus-10 Card text: static Sacral keywords -> Shortcode {{center_state}} (\"Defined\" / \"Undefined\").",
    "Template flag centerPage: inserting asks which Center the page is about (ReportPage.centerKey)."
